@startuml
Here is the repaired PlantUML:

title UML state machine diagram

state Idle
Idle : entry/To action
Idle : do/Remain in same state
Idle : exit/Login / Register

state Register
Register : entry/Register
Register : do/Register after validating
Register : exit/Login/Invalid registration

state InvalidRegistration
InvalidRegistration : entry/Invalid registration
InvalidRegistration : do/Cannot register
InvalidRegistration : exit/Abnormal termination

state Login
Login : entry/Login
Login : do/Login using valid username and password
Login : exit/Invalid login/To home page

state InvalidLogin
InvalidLogin : entry/Invalid login
InvalidLogin : do/Cannot login
InvalidLogin : exit/Abnormal termination

state CheckWeather
CheckWeather : entry/After login
CheckWeather : do/Check weather for current location or another location
CheckWeather : exit/Home / Invalid location

state ValidLocation
ValidLocation : entry/Valid location
ValidLocation : do/Choose what to check (temperature, humidity, rainfall, pressure, or dew point)
ValidLocation : exit/Update and show weather information

state InvalidLocation
InvalidLocation : entry/Invalid location
InvalidLocation : do/End process
InvalidLocation : exit/Abnormal termination

state Home
Home : entry/Update
Home : do/Update selected weather information
Home : exit/View additional weather details / Logout

state Logout
Logout : entry/Logout
Logout : do/End session
Logout : exit/Idle

CheckWeather --> ValidLocation : [valid]
ValidLocation --> Home : [user_choice]
InvalidLocation --> InvalidLocation : [invalid]
Home --> Logout : [logout]
@enduml
